{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0151-s003", "text": "Undervisningsspråket är finska eller svenska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0151-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.292388916015625, "generation_seconds": 13.292553302831948, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0151-s004", "text": "Det riktgivande kravet på språkkunskaper för gymnasieutbildning är B1.1.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0151-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.260040283203125, "generation_seconds": 28.483585508773103, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0152-s001", "text": "Yrkesexamen och specialyrkesexamen är avsedda för personer som genom arbete eller hobbyer redan har skaffat sig yrkeskunskaper inom branschen i fråga, eller som vill utveckla sin kompetens.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0152-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.185850340136055, "peak": 0.361724853515625, "generation_seconds": 53.26572084799409, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0152-s002", "text": "När man avlägger en yrkesexamen visar man sin kompetens som fackman inom sin egen bransch.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0152-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.346282958984375, "generation_seconds": 23.664752702927217, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0152-s003", "text": "Inom specialyrkesexamen visar man sin förmåga att utföra de mest krävande uppgifterna inom branschen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0152-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.297454833984375, "generation_seconds": 32.733826456125826, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0153-s001", "text": "Den studerande kan avlägga sin examen genom prov och är inte tvungen att delta i utbildningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0153-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.28271484375, "generation_seconds": 31.661423445912078, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0153-s002", "text": "Läroanstalterna anordnar också utbildning som förbereder för yrkes- och specialyrkesexamen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0153-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.319122314453125, "generation_seconds": 30.500350273912773, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0153-s003", "text": "Det är ofta möjligt att delta i utbildningen vid sidan av arbetet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054343014193+0000-4/hb-c08-u0153-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.323699951171875, "generation_seconds": 22.0157948511187, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
